  <metadata>
    <name>Juniper Canyon Trail to High Peaks</name>
    <desc>Pinnacles National Park loop from Chaparral Trailhead: Juniper Canyon Trail up to Scout Peak, High Peaks Trail (Steep and Narrow section) north, Tunnel Trail down, Juniper Canyon Trail back. Route from OpenStreetMap (ODbL); elevation from USGS 3DEP 10 m via OpenTopoData.</desc>
